    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d10">

                <pb facs="0067" n="7" xml:id="pg7"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Mr.
                        Hale.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 110.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1868-05-12"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >May</hi> 12, 1868.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> The reply of the Spanish government to the
                    modifications proposed by the allied republics of Chili, Peru, Bolivia, and
                    Ecuador, to the basis of arrangement by the President of the United States for
                    the adjustment of the difficulties between those republics and Spain having been
                    communicated to the Chilian government, has been answered in a note addressed by
                    the minister for foreign affairs of that government to the minister
                    plenipotentiary of the United States at Santiago, a translation<anchor n="*"
                        xml:id="d10-f1"/> of which I inclose, together with a copy of the dispatch
                    of General Kilpatrick, (of date March 26,) which accompanied it. You will make
                    the substance of this answer known to the Spanish government.</p>
                <p>Your dispatches to No. 129, of the 22d ultimo, have been received.</p>
                <p>I am, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">John P. Hale</hi> Esq., <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d10-f1" n="*" xml:id="d10-f1-content">
                <p>For inclosure see dispatch from United States minister to Chili of the 26th of
                    March, 1868.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
